From: Developer
Date: Thu, 06 Aug 2026
Subject: [PATCH] set ApplicationInfo sourceDir fields

Ensure Context.getPackageCodePath() returns the correct base APK path instead of failing on Linux.

--- a/src/api-impl/android/atl/ATLLoadedApp.java
+++ b/src/api-impl/android/atl/ATLLoadedApp.java
@@ -126,6 +126,8 @@
 			ATLSigHelper.addGMSSignatures(pkg);
 		}
 		pkg.applicationInfo.sourceDir = mainApk;
+		// Set publicSourceDir so Context.getPackageCodePath() returns the real APK path
+		pkg.applicationInfo.publicSourceDir = mainApk;
 		return new ATLLoadedApp(resources, classLoader, pkg);
 	}

